            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nI can not reproduce on Kitty 0.41.1.\n\nThe `Build type: RelWithDebInfo` for 0.11.0 has proven to result in some issues. Could you please update to use fully released version? It should `Build type: Release`.\n\n> Calling mini.misc.setup_termbg_sync() fails with the following error:\n\nThat's not an error, that is a warning. It looks like error only because it invokes a press-enter-prompt, which usually doesn't happen with `vim.notify()` override (like from 'mini.notfiy').",
