            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Hmm... Yes, I was able to reproduce this now with `vim.defer_fn(...)`. This doesn't happen with `MiniDeps.later()` (which is what is recommend to be used anyway). **Edit**: It does indeed happen sometimes with `later()`... 🤔 \n\nI'll take a closer look, but I'd still recommend using either `now()` or `later()` here. Or directly execute in the 'init.lua', or any other lazy loading.",
