        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should now be fixed on latest `main`. That response was from Neovim itself, as it makes several requests to terminal emulator during startup. The logic of `setup_termbg_sync()` is now more robust: it doesn't expect proper response right away but rather waits until either proper response or the timeout. Thanks for catching this!",
